{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.BoxBraidIrreducibility","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.BoxBraidIrreducibility","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BoxBraidIrreducibility","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BoxBraidIrreducibility","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L148-L151","doc":"Top-level alias matching the manifest declaration. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:box-braid-irreducibility","label":"prop:box-braid-irreducibility","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.neutrino_energy_barrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.neutrino_energy_barrier","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L116-L146","doc":"**Neutrino stability**: the neutrino mass m_ν ~ μ₀(q-1) is\nfar below the T(3,5) crossing energy barrier.\nThe ratio E_box / m_ν ≥ 10(q+q⁻¹)/q ≈ 19 at q = 1.1097. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.box_braid_min_crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.box_braid_min_crossings","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L108-L114","doc":"**Box braid irreducibility**: the γγ → νν̄ box requires\n≥ 10 crossings (= 10 R-matrix applications = 10 Planck steps).\nNo simpler process exists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.photon_neutrino_requires_T35","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.photon_neutrino_requires_T35","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L89-L106","doc":"The process γγ → νν̄ requires the T(3,5) mediator.\nReason: photons (Q=0, no knot) cannot couple to neutrinos\n(Q=0, unknot) without charged intermediaries (trefoils, Q≠0),\nand the only charged-to-neutral mediator on the genus-4\nBring's surface is T(3,5).\n\nThe Lean content is the topological invariant of that mediator:\nthe T(3,5) sub-topology has crossing number 10 and is realised by\nthe braid word `(σ₀σ₁)⁵` of length 10 in B₃ (braid index 3). This\nis the irreducible cost of the γ–ν interaction — 10 R-matrix\napplications / Planck steps (cf. `box_braid_min_crossings`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.T35_braid_word_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.T35_braid_word_length","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L72-L76","doc":"T(3,5) has braid word (σ₀σ₁)⁵ with 10 crossings in B₃. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.torusBraidWordLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.torusBraidWordLength","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L67-L70","doc":"The braid word for T(m,n) in B_m is (σ₀σ₁⋯σ_{m-2})^n,\nwhich has exactly (m-1)*n crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.T35_braid_index","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.T35_braid_index","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L61-L65","doc":"The braid index of T(3,5) is 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.braidIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.braidIndex","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L55-L59","doc":"The braid index of T(m,n) is min(m,n). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.T35_crossing_number","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.T35_crossing_number","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L49-L53","doc":"The crossing number of T(3,5) is 10. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.T35","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.T35","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L40-L47","doc":"The weak mediator T(3,5). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L34-L38","doc":"The crossing number of a torus knot T(m,n) is\nmin((m-1)*n, (n-1)*m). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.coprime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.coprime","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_lt_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_lt_n","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_ge_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_ge_two","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.n","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot","kind":"structure","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/box-braid-irreducibility.lean#L25-L32","doc":"A torus knot T(m,n) with coprime winding numbers. ","signatureChunk":0}]}